  "quickPrompts": [
    {
      "zh": "用 Hello Dev 受控交付流程帮我完成一个改造任务：先确认边界和授权，再分解成可独立验证的子任务并按波次推进，最后给出带证据的交付结论。",
      "en": "Run a governed Hello Dev delivery for my change: confirm scope and authorization, decompose into independently verifiable subtasks, execute by waves, and deliver with evidence."
    },
    {
      "zh": "把这份需求拆成可并行的子任务：标出依赖、波次顺序和每个任务会改哪些文件，并指出同波文件冲突需要降级串行的地方。",
      "en": "Decompose this requirement into parallelizable subtasks: list dependencies, wave order, the files each task touches, and where same-wave file conflicts force sequential execution."
    },
    {
      "zh": "这次改动有没有被真正验证过？先列出它可能破坏的风险，再逐条给出构建、回归、行为和边界四层的实证，别只告诉我测试跑绿了。",
      "en": "Has this change actually been verified? List the risks it could break, then give build, regression, behavior and boundary evidence for each one - do not just tell me the tests passed."
    }
  ],
